[70.178151, "o", "\u001b[32m✔ selectors parse key=value \u001b[90m(1.747693ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ resources group by branch tag \u001b[90m(0.23826ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ summary warns about untagged resources \u001b[90m(0.316623ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan includes untagged resources created by the branch's stack \u001b[90m(0.348954ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan deletes dependents before the resources they depend on \u001b[90m(0.259841ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ branch selection uses exact tags or stack IDs, not name prefixes \u001b[90m(0.187212ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ deletion order handles shared dependencies in arbitrary listing order without mutation \u001b[90m(0.682006ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ plan reports external dependents without selecting them or external dependencies \u001b[90m(0.198731ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[32m✔ empty plans are safe and cycles fail before any deletion \u001b[90m(0.650225ms)\u001b[39m\u001b[39m\r\n"]
